accepted preliminary model. Unsupported versions must not fall back to legacy pricing.\"\n          },\n          \"reinforcement_design\": {\n            \"type\": \"object\",\n            \"description\": \"Accepted versioned raw reinforcement geometry. Not engineering approval, structural capacity or a stock purchasing schedule.\",\n            \"additionalProperties\": true\n          },\n          \"reinforcement_material\": {\n            \"type\": \"object\",\n            \"description\": \"Explicit stable catalog identity or authored manual per-foot material basis for the accepted reinforcement design.\",\n            \"additionalProperties\": true\n          },\n          \"reinforcement_proposal\": {\n            \"type\": \"object\",\n            \"description\": \"Unapplied versioned editor draft, including incomplete raw text. Never authoritative for live pricing or downstream material handoff.\",\n            \"additionalProperties\": true\n          },\n          \"reinforcement_cost_snapshot\": {\n            \"type\": \"object\",\n            \"description\": \"Latest deterministic version-2 steel quantities, material/labor amounts and basis. Builder frozen pricing is separate; engineering and procurement approval remain false.\",\n            \"additionalProperties\": true\n          },\n          \"reinforcement_acceptance\": {\n            \"type\": \"object\",\n            \"description\": \"Historical local model-acceptance receipt with origin actor, source, component, revision, timestamp and warnings. Audit metadata only, never authorization or engineering approval.\",\n            \"additionalProperties\": true\n          },\n          \"include_forming\": {\n            \"type\": \"boolean\",\n            \"default\": true\n          },\n          \"selected_forming_id\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"include_finishing\": {\n            \"type\": \"boolean\",\n            \"default\": true\n          },\n    